<% provide(:title, 'about') %>
<div class="container">

  <div class="center-text">
    <h1>How to Use This Site</h1>
  </div>

  <hr>
  <section>

    <div class="form-style">
      <h3>Step 1: Sign In or Sign Up</h3>
      <p>Create an account by clicking "Sign Up" or sign in if a returning user.</p>

      <h3>Step 2: Create a Trip</h3>
      <p>Click "My Trips" to view your trips and click "Create New Trip" to get started!</p>

      <h3>Step 2: Add Participants</h3>
      <p>When creating a trip, don't forget to add the users traveling with you by checking the box by their name! </p>

      <h3>Step 3: Log Expenses</h3>
      <p>After creating a trip, click "Add Expenses" to create expenses that will need to be paid, and who needs to pay
        them.</p>

      <h3>Step 4: Settle Payments</h3>
      <p>Once all expenses are made, click "View Settlements" to calculate how much each participant needs owe!</p>

      <h3>Step 5: Enjoy</h3>
      <p>Enjoy the trip you've planned!</p>


    </div>
  </section>

</div>
